# AI 协作平台 - Project Tech Stack

## Frontend
- **Framework**: Next.js (React with App Router)
- **Language**: TypeScript
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui
- **State Management**: Zustand
- **Authentication**: NextAuth.js (with FastAPI backend integration)
- **Internationalization**: i18n support (English/Chinese)
- **Real-time Communication**: FastAPI WebSockets (native WebSocket API)
- **Package Manager**: pnpm
- **Build Tools**: Next.js built-in (Webpack/SWC)

## Backend
- **Language**: Python
- **Framework**: FastAPI
- **ASGI Server**: Uvicorn (managed by Gunicorn for production)
- **Authentication**: FastAPI Security (OAuth2 with JWT)
- **API Architecture**: REST with WebSocket support
- **Task Queue**: ARQ (Async Redis Queue)

## AI & LLM Integration
- **AI Framework**: LangChain
- **AI Orchestration**: LangGraph
- **Multi-Agent System**: Custom implementation with @ mention system
- **Vector Database**: ChromaDB (initial) / pgvector (PostgreSQL integration)
- **Memory Management**: LangChain memory modules

## Database
- **Primary Database**: PostgreSQL
- **ORM**: TORTOISE_ORM (Python)
- **Database Migrations**: Aerich
- **Vector Storage**: pgvector (PostgreSQL extension) / ChromaDB
- **Caching**: Redis

## Infrastructure & DevOps
- **Containerization**: Docker, Docker Compose
- **Development Environment**: Local Docker setup
- **Database**: PostgreSQL with pgvector extension
- **Cache Layer**: Redis server
- **Task Processing**: ARQ workers with Redis

## Payment & Commerce (Future)
- **Payment Gateway**: Stripe (recommended)
- **Subscription Management**: Stripe Subscriptions
- **Webhook Processing**: FastAPI endpoints with ARQ task queue

## Authentication & Security
- **Backend Auth**: FastAPI Security with OAuth2/JWT
- **Frontend Auth**: NextAuth.js integration
- **Social Login**: OAuth providers (Google, GitHub)
- **Session Management**: JWT tokens
- **API Security**: Input validation with Pydantic

## Development Tools
- **Version Control**: Git
- **Code Quality**: 
  - Python: Black, Flake8/Ruff, isort, mypy
  - Frontend: ESLint, Prettier
- **Pre-commit Hooks**: pre-commit framework
- **Testing**: Pytest (backend), Jest/React Testing Library (frontend)
- **Dependency Management**: 
  - Python: PDM or Poetry
  - Frontend: npm/pnpm

## Project Architecture
- **Design Pattern**: Microservices-ready monolith
- **API Versioning**: `/api/v1/` structure
- **Real-time Features**: WebSocket connections for chat
- **Async Processing**: ARQ for background tasks
- **Plugin System**: Extensible architecture for AI agents and external integrations

## Environment Configuration
- **Development**: Docker Compose with hot reloading
- **Testing**: Automated testing with CI/CD pipeline
- **Production**: Containerized deployment with Gunicorn/Uvicorn
- **Environment Variables**: `.env` files with example templates

## Future Integrations
- **Third-party APIs**: OAuth 2.0 client flows for external services
- **Plugin Architecture**: Dynamic tool/agent loading system
- **Secrets Management**: HashiCorp Vault or cloud secret managers
- **Advanced Auth**: Auth0, Clerk, or Supabase Auth consideration

---

**Development Phases**:
- **Phase 1**: Human-AI collaboration with @ mention system
- **Phase 2**: Autonomous AI task planning and execution
- **Commercial Features**: User registration, subscription management, plugin marketplace

**Note**: This is a bilingual platform (Chinese/English) with focus on AI agent collaboration and extensible plugin architecture.